                                                "sense_id": "2073b8cb-c21a-38c7-a470-f42cf855b463",
                                                "text": "3.1.2 The Australian dollar in the global bond market An internationalized currency also serves non-residents as a store of value ... borrowers issuing Australian dollar bonds in the domestic market (foreign bonds known as ' kangaroo bonds')."
                                            },
